Scope and third-party material
------------------------------
This notice covers only the WorkChoose contributions described above. WorkChoose
does not claim ownership of, and this license does not grant rights to:

* Manufacturer names, trademarks, logos, or other brand assets.
* Manufacturer-original facts, manuals, support text, or other linked source
  content, which remain third-party material and should be checked against the
  official source.
* Product photographs, logos used in source pages, or other images. A field such
  as image_slug is only a data reference; it does not license an image.

The CSVs are specification-backed snapshots, not hands-on test results. They do
not promise current prices, stock, availability, compatibility, safety,
durability, noise, or delivered dimensions. A blank or "Unknown" field means
the cited material did not establish a reliable value; do not treat it as a
pass or fill it with an estimate. Verify the exact model, region, variant,
manual, and current manufacturer source before relying on a row.

No automatic update schedule is promised. Source pages, products, policies, and
regional listings can change after the snapshot was reviewed.
